│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  To solve this task, I will:                                                                                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  1. Use the `supervisor` app to get the user's file system password.                                                                                                                                 │
│  2. Use the `file_system` app to:                                                                                                                                                                    │
│     - List all files in the `~/downloads/` directory.                                                                                                                                                │
│     - For each file, retrieve its creation date.                                                                                                                                                     │
│     - Rename the file with the prefix `YYYY-MM-DD_`.                                                                                                                                                 │
│     - Move files not created this year to the `~/trash/` directory.                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  Let's start by retrieving the file system password.                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  ```python                                                                                                                                                                                           │
│  # Get the file system password from the supervisor app                                                                                                                                              │
│  passwords = apis.supervisor.show_account_passwords()                                                                                                                                                │
│  file_system_password = [p["password"] for p in passwords if p["account_name"] == "file_system"][0]                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  # Print the password for confirmation (optional)                                                                                                                                                    │
│  print(file_system_password)                                                                                                                                                                         │
│  ```                                                                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
